cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MITA Open Blueprint: A BCM & BPT Data Repository"
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable dataset of the CMS Medicaid Information Technology
  Architecture (MITA) Framework version 3.0 (May 2014 Update). Contains 152
  documents (76 Business Process Templates and 76 Business Capability Models)
  converted from the official CMS appendix PDFs to structured JSON, spanning
  nine MITA business areas. Every record retains source file and page range
  metadata so any claim can be traced back to the originating CMS document.
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-01-12"
url: "https://github.com/nickarrow/mita-open-blueprint"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nickarrow/mita-open-blueprint"
authors:
